<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2f21d5fcfd3c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "CBS Mornings host Gayle King shared about a video created of her endorsing a medical supplement." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3383" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3016f6044b83> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "They look like they're from the Food Network or other big names in the news world." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3381" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/58a73085e9e5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The list of impersonated stars includes: Lainey Wilson" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3381" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/764c696712bf> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The list of impersonated stars includes: Jennifer Lopez" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3381" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8074841ffc81> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "They're using Taylor Swift's names all over it!" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3381" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8664c1e87ef7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Ree Drummond is warning her fans in a social media post about a fake video of Ree doing a cookware giveaway." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3383" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/897c7ba326a4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The list of impersonated stars includes: Ree Drummond" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3381" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b397ecb04278> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The list of impersonated stars includes: Oprah" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3381" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b5058b16c646> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Actor Tom Hanks has spoken on social media about an AI video created of him doing a dental commercial." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3383" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/bdb52802633e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The list of impersonated stars includes: Trisha Yearwood" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3381" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/db7f438e244c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "It's got Taylor Swift and Selena Gomez's names all over it!" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3381" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/de33e38f5eda> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Le Creuset confirmed they were running no such deals, and had no association with Swift." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3382" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e60a39dde1a3> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "It's all about a fake giveaway of Le Creuset cookware, and guess what?" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3381" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f4e791b95ae3> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The list of impersonated stars includes: Martha Stewart" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3381" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fe2042dc6a81> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In addition to external fraudulent websites, the supposed Ree Drummond free Le Creuset giveaway also flows heavily through major social channels like Facebook, Instagram and TikTok using manipulated video content and psychological tactics deceiving users." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3384" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4283589e0807> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Federal Trade Commission says these videos are known as deep fakes, artificial intelligence using someone's face and voice." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3383" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1f320204426a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In the increasing list of AI-generated scams, fraudsters have now produced counterfeit advertisements featuring Taylor Swift for a high-end cookware brand Le Creuset." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3382" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7140559ef824> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Johansson also sued an app by the name of Lisa AI: 90s Yearbook & Avatar for using her voice and face in its ad." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3382" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c1341f52bc3d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "These videos popped up all over Meta (the folks behind Facebook and Instagram) and TikTok." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3381" .

